# Hero Slider Customization

**Description**: This rule documents the hero slider customization system in the super-admin panel. Use it when modifying the hero editor, adding new slots, or configuring fonts.

## Slot Structure

### Desktop
- `topLeftTextBanner` — Headline (title, subtitle, typography)
- `rightBanner` — Main visual (background + foreground image; 1:1 aspect ratio recommended)
- `bottomActionBannerLeft` — Card 1 (image, title, button; product/category image)
- `bottomActionBannerRight` — Card 2 (image, title, button; product/category image)

### Tablet
- `primaryBanner` — Headline
- `heroBanner` — Main visual
- `bottomActionBannerLeft` — Card 1
- `bottomActionBannerRight` — Card 2

### Mobile
- Same slot keys as tablet

## Auto-Sync: Desktop to Tablet and Mobile

When desktop slides are done, tablet and mobile slides are auto-generated from desktop content:

1. **On save draft**: Tablet and mobile slots are automatically synced from desktop before saving. Content (title, subtitle, images, links, tracking) is copied; styling uses device-specific defaults (not desktop styling).
2. **Manual sync button**: "همگام‌سازی تبلت و موبایل از دسکتاپ" in the PublishBar runs the sync immediately (in-memory, without saving).

**Slot mapping** (desktop → tablet/mobile):
| Desktop | Tablet | Mobile |
|---------|--------|--------|
| `topLeftTextBanner` | `primaryBanner` | `primaryBanner` |
| `rightBanner` | `heroBanner` | `heroBanner` |
| `bottomActionBannerLeft` | `bottomActionBannerLeft` | `bottomActionBannerLeft` |
| `bottomActionBannerRight` | `bottomActionBannerRight` | `bottomActionBannerRight` |

**Implementation**: `syncTabletAndMobileFromDesktop` in [frontend/src/types/super-admin/heroSlider.ts](frontend/src/types/super-admin/heroSlider.ts) extracts content from desktop slots and passes it through `normalizeHeadlineSlot`, `normalizeCardSlot`, `normalizeMainVisualSlot` with device-specific defaults.

## CMS Mapping

- Editor payload (`HeroSliderPayload`) is stored via `/settings/hero-slider/draft` (PUT) and published via `/settings/hero-slider/publish` (POST).
- `mapHeroSlideToLayoutsForEditor` in [frontend/src/components/Hero/config/fromCms.ts](frontend/src/components/Hero/config/fromCms.ts) maps `HeroSlideConfig` to `CmsHeroEditorLayouts` (desktop, tablet, mobile).
- Layout specs are applied to Hero components: `TextBanner`, `ActionBanner`, `LeftBanner`.

## Placeholders

When image URLs are empty, the editor uses slot-specific placeholders:
- **Main visual** (`rightBanner` / `heroBanner`): `hero-main-placeholder.svg` — "تصویر اصلی - نسبت ۱:۱ توصیه می‌شود"
- **Cards** (`bottomActionBannerLeft` / `bottomActionBannerRight`): `hero-card-placeholder.svg` — "کارت - تصویر محصول یا دسته‌بندی"

Files: [frontend/public/images/placeholders/](frontend/public/images/placeholders/)

## Font Configuration

To add new fonts for the hero font selector:

1. Add font files to `frontend/public/fonts/`
2. Register in `frontend/src/styles/fonts.ts` (e.g. `@font-face` and export)
3. Add the font to Tailwind in `frontend/tailwind.config.ts` under `fontFamily`
4. Add the option to `HERO_FONT_FAMILY_OPTIONS` in [frontend/src/types/super-admin/heroSlider.ts](frontend/src/types/super-admin/heroSlider.ts)

## Background Image URLs

Strapi stores image paths like `/uploads/...`. At **render time**, `LeftBanner` and `ActionBanner` resolve these to absolute URLs using [frontend/src/utils/resolveAssetUrl.ts](frontend/src/utils/resolveAssetUrl.ts) (and `NEXT_PUBLIC_IMAGE_BASE_URL`) so background images load correctly. Stored payloads remain path-only; resolution is not persisted.

## Hero Editor File Layout

- **TemplatePreview.tsx** — Main preview + device switcher + side panel; imports from editors, canvases, utils.
- **utils.ts** — `getFrameByDevice`, `slotLabelMap`, `makeLayoutsSafe`, `resolveColorForInput`, `safeImageSrc`; exports `DeviceMode`, `SlotKey`.
- **EditableSlot.tsx** — Wrapper for click-to-edit slots in the preview.
- **editors/** — Slot editors: `TextStyleEditor`, `HeadlineEditor`, `MainVisualEditor`, `CardEditor`, `SlotEditorContent` (index re-exports).
- **canvases/** — Device-specific preview canvases: `DesktopCanvas`, `TabletCanvas`, `MobileCanvas`.

## Style Packages (Presets)

Headline and card slots support **پکیج استایل** (Apply preset). Presets are defined in [frontend/src/types/super-admin/heroSliderPackages.ts](frontend/src/types/super-admin/heroSliderPackages.ts): `HERO_HEADLINE_STYLE_PRESETS` and `HERO_CARD_STYLE_PRESETS` (e.g. مینیمال, بولد, الگنت). Selecting a preset merges its `titleStyle` / `subtitleStyle` or `titleStyle` / `buttonStyle` into the current slot.

## Font Size Labels (xl, 2xl, 3xl)

Font size dropdowns show human-friendly labels via `getFontSizeDisplayLabel()` and [HERO_FONT_SIZE_DISPLAY_LABELS](frontend/src/types/super-admin/heroSlider.ts) (e.g. xs, sm, md, lg, xl, 2xl, 3xl). Stored values remain Tailwind tokens; only the UI labels changed.

## Key Files

- [frontend/src/app/(super-admin)/super-admin/settings/customization/hero-slider/page.tsx](frontend/src/app/(super-admin)/super-admin/settings/customization/hero-slider/page.tsx) — Page
- [frontend/src/hooks/useHeroSliderEditor.ts](frontend/src/hooks/useHeroSliderEditor.ts) — **useHeroSliderEditor**: Custom hook that owns all hero slider editor state, effects, and handlers. Responsibilities: data fetch (`getHeroSliderDraftAndPublished`), draft/published/meta state, selected slide/slot/device syncing, slide CRUD (add, duplicate, delete, reorder), slot updates, save draft (with auto-sync of tablet/mobile from desktop), publish, `syncTabletMobileFromDesktop` for manual sync, link/tracking changes. Exposes minimal API: `isLoading`, `isSavingDraft`, `isPublishing`, `draft`, `published`, `meta`, `selectedSlide`, `selectedSlot`, `slotTrackingForForm`, selection setters, and handler functions.
- [frontend/src/components/SuperAdmin/HeroSliderEditor/TemplatePreview.tsx](frontend/src/components/SuperAdmin/HeroSliderEditor/TemplatePreview.tsx) — Preview + in-place editing
- [frontend/src/components/SuperAdmin/HeroSliderEditor/editors/](frontend/src/components/SuperAdmin/HeroSliderEditor/editors/) — Slot editors
- [frontend/src/components/SuperAdmin/HeroSliderEditor/canvases/](frontend/src/components/SuperAdmin/HeroSliderEditor/canvases/) — Device canvases
- [frontend/src/components/Hero/config/fromCms.ts](frontend/src/components/Hero/config/fromCms.ts) — CMS → layout mapping
- [frontend/src/types/super-admin/heroSlider.ts](frontend/src/types/super-admin/heroSlider.ts) — Types, defaults, `syncTabletAndMobileFromDesktop`
- [frontend/src/types/super-admin/heroSliderPackages.ts](frontend/src/types/super-admin/heroSliderPackages.ts) — Style presets
